 "notes": "Computation-only paper; no PRC. Spine: need -> gap -> VTaCrW -> SQS-DFT -> imposed random occupancy -> local lattice distortion -> broad vacancy energetics (explained by local-environment relaxation) || [110] dumbbells -> slowed interstitials; both meet at the recombination MEC -> irradiation tolerance (argued from literature) -> conclusion. Histogram readouts typed with the proposed OBS/response/distribution and the proposed mm_op read_distribution_statistics (fallback: OBS/response/characteristic_value + read_characteristic_point). The PRF claim rests on literature experiments plus an interstitial migration spectrum that no packet figure shows. Lost: PDOS/Bader argument (F2), Voronoi volumes (Table 1), F5 per-element relaxation histogram (not opened).",
